notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3043/304303/技能2 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3043/304303/大招.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3043/304303/大招 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3043/304303/入场.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3043/304303/入场 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"304303\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-304304.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/39/Belonging-304304.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“恒久璀璨”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Everlasting Radiance\"</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />75<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一条款式华贵的颈饰，当中的主石尤其夺人眼目。她经手过无数璀璨夺目的虚伪，但漫步在熟悉的古城中时，她显然选择给自己一些真实的犒赏。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-304305.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/8/8c/Belonging-304305.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">华美披肩<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Luxury Shawl</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />4.8<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>品质上佳的丝绸披肩，与考究的库尔塔衫相得益彰。坦南特能轻而易举地扮成一位本地绅士，对这项技能的练习，可以追溯到她于这座城市中漫游的时期。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-304306.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/93/Belonging-304306.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“攀援者”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"The Crawler\"</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />0.7<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一只造型蜿蜒的银手镯，灵巧地攀附于手腕之上。坦南特在德里的一家小店中发现了它，并成功地在一刻钟内将价格谈到了原价的十分之一。这是一次放松的小小消遣，事实上，她并不认为那颗红玻璃是它的瑕疵。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%BE%B7%E9%87%8C%E6%BC%AB%E6%AD%A51.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 德里漫步1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%BE%B7%E9%87%8C%E6%BC%AB%E6%AD%A51.jpg/216px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%BE%B7%E9%87%8C%E6%BC%AB%E6%AD%A51.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"216\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%BE%B7%E9%87%8C%E6%BC%AB%E6%AD%A51.jpg/325px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%BE%B7%E9%87%8C%E6%BC%AB%E6%AD%A51.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%BE%B7%E9%87%8C%E6%BC%AB%E6%AD%A51.jpg/433px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%BE%B7%E9%87%8C%E6%BC%AB%E6%AD%A51.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1620\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%BE%B7%E9%87%8C%E6%BC%AB%E6%AD%A52.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 德里漫步2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%BE%B7%E9%87%8C%E6%BC%AB%E6%AD%A52.jpg/216px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%BE%B7%E9%87%8C%E6%BC%AB%E6%AD%A52.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"216\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%BE%B7%E9%87%8C%E6%BC%AB%E6%AD%A52.jpg/325px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%BE%B7%E9%87%8C%E6%BC%AB%E6%AD%A52.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%BE%B7%E9%87%8C%E6%BC%AB%E6%AD%A52.jpg/433px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%BE%B7%E9%87%8C%E6%BC%AB%E6%AD%A52.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1620\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], 